# .editorconfig tells editors what to write; this tells git what to store.
# Both are needed: without it, committing from Windows can bake CRLF into
# `gradlew`, which then fails on a Linux CI runner with a confusing error.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.db binary
